sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as App
  participant Auth as Auth Server
  participant R as Resource
  U->>A: click login
  A->>Auth: redirect authorize
  Auth->>U: login page
  U->>Auth: credentials
  Auth-->>A: authorization code
  A->>+Auth: exchange code
  Auth-->>-A: access token
  A->>+R: GET /data (token)
  R-->>-A: protected data
  A-->>U: show data
